  "downloads": 1404,
  "description": "<blockquote>\n<p><strong>This addon contains content with strong language</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>A collection of 60+ markings, symbols and more that I’ve recreated by hand from viewing photos of real life operator weapons and other video games (CoD 4, BF6 etc).</p>\n<p>I drew everything in the style of paint markers such as posca for a more fielded look.\nI’ll occasionally be updating this sticker pack as I see more cool markings and such overtime, I am also open to user suggestions.</p>\n<p>If you want to add more wear and tear to your markings, try using a mask texture.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>How to install</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>To install addon, drag and drop BepInEx folder into your SPT install directory.\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/afNPjAw.gif\" alt=\"Install\" title=\"Install\" /></p>\n",
